- Added text input area in Untagged Templates block for pasting AI-returned tags
- Added [Apply Tags] button that parses 5-line tag format (MainRoute/ShadowRoute/TrapRoles/Budget/TestGoal)
- Runtime fields updated immediately on apply
- Source file (LevelSnippetLibrary.cs) auto-persisted via regex-based rewrite
- Confirmation dialog before write, success/failure feedback in Console
- Tolerant parser: supports Chinese/English colons, optional prefixes, case-insensitive keys
- Updated subtitle and CopyTagPrompt log message to reference new workflow
- Zero external dependencies, compiles standalone under Unity Editor
